# Locker Room, cast as the right door: "Whenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card." (CR 603.2c) The
# trigger is one for the whole batch. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus and two Moxen) beside two Memnites. On turn 3 both Memnites hit Bot2 together
# (2 damage) and one card is drawn, not two (library 13 -> 12 for the draw step -> 11); on turn 5 a single Memnite attacks and, being the one
# creature "one or more" counts, draws one more (-> 9 with the draw step).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Memnite
Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

