Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bottomless Pool // Locker Room.Cast(Ability: Locker Room)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Locker Room.Doors = Locker Room
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Attack(Memnite#1 > Bot2; Memnite#2 > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
